WEBVTT

00:38:58.746 --> 00:39:02.288
But another version of that is
and I think this applies at

00:39:02.288 --> 00:39:05.246
the technical level, at the company level,
at the societal level,

00:39:05.663 --> 00:39:07.371
incentives are superpower's.

00:39:07.913 --> 00:39:09.204
Charlie Munger had this thing on,

00:39:09.246 --> 00:39:12.996
which is incentives are so powerful that
if you can spend any time whatsoever

00:39:13.204 --> 00:39:14.788
working on the incentive system,

00:39:15.079 --> 00:39:17.288
that's what you should do before
you work on anything else.

00:39:17.579 --> 00:39:18.829
And I really believe that.

00:39:19.163 --> 00:39:22.538
And I think that applies to the
individual models we build

00:39:22.538 --> 00:39:24.079
and what their reward functions look like.

00:39:24.579 --> 00:39:27.288
I think it applies to society
in a big way,

00:39:27.788 --> 00:39:30.788
and I think it applies to our
corporate structure at open.